{
	quest.0BBDB63F944F61A7.quest_desc: ["Using an &3Ender Pearl&r on an &aAurora Bloom&r will change it into an &3Ender Bloom&r. \\n\\nWe can Harvest these for &3Aurora Ender Shards&r, which can be Crafted with another one to make an &3Ender Pearl&r. \\n\\n&3Ender Blooms&r will Drop as well but have to be Planted on &eEnd Stone&r to Grow them."]
	quest.0BBDB63F944F61A7.title: "&3Ender Blooms"
	quest.0D3D987594E64A86.quest_desc: ["The &3Glacial Basin&r will collect &bLiquid Aurora&r. \\n\\nIt goes up to Level 3 and only with Level 3 we can use Items on it to &bInfuse&r them with &bAurora&r. \\n\\nThe more &3Basins&r, the more &bAurora&r you can Collect!"]
	quest.0D3D987594E64A86.title: "&bAuroral Infusion"
	quest.11AD7F883D777339.quest_desc: ["The &bAu&aro&dra&r gives us another Mob, this one is a change with a Mob already given to us by &2&lVanilla&r. \\n\\nTake a Snow Golem (2 Blocks of Snow with a &6Carved Pumpkin&r on top) and hand them an &dAurora Shard&r to make an Auroral Snowlette. \\n\\nAuroral Snowlettes are tiny Purple Snowmen. They don't Shoot Mobs with Snowballs they just Follow you and Glow. \\n\\nYou can Shift Right Click to make them Sit still and Feed them Snowballs to Heal them."]
	quest.11AD7F883D777339.title: "Auroral Snowlettes"
	quest.1EE5BFB935D345F3.quest_desc: ["&bFrozen Petals&r are Dropped from mature &aAurora Blooms&r. We can do a ton with them! \\n\\nWe can Craft Food Items and &2Glow Leek Seeds&r. \\n\\n&dCold Brewing Stands&r are a Block we can make with them as well, plus we can use &bFrozen Petals&r to Brew Awkward Potions. \\n\\nWe can &bInfuse&r them to unlock even more Recipes and most importantly... \\n\\nIf you Shift Right Click on any Snow with 2 Empty Hands, you'll leave a Snow Angel in the Snow. Right Click the Snow Angel with a &bFrozen Petal&r and it won't disappear."]
	quest.1EE5BFB935D345F3.title: "&bFrozen Petals"
	quest.1F880C6A777B4199.quest_desc: ["&aAurora Blooms&r will Grow randomly during &bAu&aro&dras&r. \\n\\nThey can Grow on or in Snow, Layered Snow, Powdered Snow, and &bIce&r. \\n\\nWhen fully Grown you can Break them to get &bFrozen Petals&r and another &aAurora Bloom&r. \\n\\nOnce it is &eDaytime&r and the &bAu&aro&dra&r is over, the &aBlooms&r will all disappear, including ones you've Placed. \\n\\nUnless you've used Silk Touch to Harvest them. If you do you'll only get a Decorative Bloom which lasts forever but doesn't Drop &bPetals&r."]
	quest.1F880C6A777B4199.title: "&aAurora Blooms"
	quest.2AB2456B6B8EEAD8.quest_desc: ["&5Shimmerweave Armor&r is made by combining Iron Armor, a &bShimmer Template&r, and &5Shimmerweave Fabric&r. \\n\\nThe full set has 20 Armor Points and 8 Armor Toughness, same as &cNetherite&r. \\n\\nThe &5Goggles&r will give Glowing to Hostile Mobs. \\n\\nThe &5Tunic&r will put out &cFire&r that is currently burning your skin off. \\n\\nThe &5Leggings&r will give a Speed Boost on Snow, Soul Sand, and Soul Soil. \\n\\nLast, the &5Skates&r will make you Walk faster on &bIce&r but with less friction. You'll also Freeze &9Water&r and turn &cLava&r into &5Obsidian&r by Walking over it. It also removes Fall Damage when you land on &bIce&r or &5Obsidian&r."]
	quest.2AB2456B6B8EEAD8.title: "&5Shimmerweave Armor"
	quest.2AFAE2215A774DBA.quest_desc: ["&5Shimmerweave&r is made from &bInfusing Woven Leather&r in a &3Glacial Basin&r. \\n\\n&bWoven Leather&r is just Wool and Leather Crafted together. \\n\\nIt's only use is making the 4 Pieces of &5Shimmerweave Armor&r... not much else."]
	quest.2AFAE2215A774DBA.title: "&5Shimmerweave Fabric"
	quest.2EEBCCE507CF5D67.quest_desc: ["&dPotions&r can be pretty annoying to make for a dozen reasons. \\n\\n&dBrewing Stands&r require going to the &c&lNether&r to Craft and Fuel. Too many Items and Recipes to keep track of. Bottles you have to keep Dropping and Refueling. \\n\\n&dCold Brewing Stands&r fix the first issue, the rest it can't help with. \\n\\n&dCold Brewing Stands&r use the same Recipes but are Crafted with &bFrozen Petals&r and use Snowballs as Fuel instead of &cBlaze Powder&r."]
	quest.2EEBCCE507CF5D67.title: "&dCold Brewing Stand"
	quest.2FB85057F0F9CE7A.quest_desc: ["&dAurora Shards&r are important Crafting Ingredients. \\n\\n&bInfusing Frozen Petals&r will give us &dAurora Shards&r. \\n\\nWe'll need them to Craft &bShimmer Smithing Templates&r, &5Hearthwood Logs&r, and &9Aurora Lanterns&r. \\n\\nThey're also used in Taming Mobs from the &b&lAu&aro&dral&r."]
	quest.2FB85057F0F9CE7A.title: "&dAurora Shards"
	quest.3AD8A3E543ADABD1.quest_desc: ["Used to make &bShimmersteel Gear&r and &5Shimmerweave Armor&r. \\n\\nAll Gear made with &bShimmersteel&r and Armor made with &5Shimmerweave&r will repair themselves if they're Equipped during an &bAu&aro&dra&r."]
	quest.3AD8A3E543ADABD1.title: "&bShimmer Smithing Templates"
	quest.57A31EBE7312995D.quest_desc: ["&bShimmersteel Tools&r all have their own unique abilities. \\n\\n&bShovels&r come with Silk Touch. \\n\\n&bHoes&r also have Silk Touch and can be used on Snow to make &aShimmer Soil&r. \\n\\n&bAxes&r can be used on &6Copper Blocks&r to make them Oxidize, the opposite of stripping them like Axes usually do! \\n\\n&bPickaxes&r are the same Tier as Iron Pickaxes and come with Fortune 3, but only for Gems. I know that includes &bDiamonds&r and &aEmeralds&r... I don't know what else."]
	quest.57A31EBE7312995D.title: "&bShimmersteel Tools"
	quest.584C5A1F7563F8C8.quest_desc: ["We have 3 &bShimmersteel Weapons&r we can use: &bSword&f, &bSpear&f, and &bBow&r. \\n\\nThe &bSword&r will give Mobs Frostbite when you Hit them below a certain amount of Health. \\n\\nThe &bSpear&r will do the same just for any Hits regardless of the Mobs Health. Including a bonus Damage if there is an &bAu&aro&dra&r happening. \\n\\nThe &bBow&r doesn't use Arrows, instead it uses Snowballs! When Mobs are Hit with the Snowball they'll take Damage. If they are Hit or near the Snowball they'll get Effected with Blindness and Glowing."]
	quest.584C5A1F7563F8C8.title: "&bShimmersteel Weapons"
	quest.58799D0038E198DF.quest_desc: ["&bShimmersteel&r is the Ingot we get from &l&bAu&aro&dral&r. \\n\\nIt starts by Crafting the Unrefined version with &6Copper&r, Iron, and &0Coal&r. \\n\\nThen, &bInfuse&r it by tossing it into a full &3Glacial Basin&r and we'll get our &bShimmersteel Ingot&r!"]
	quest.58799D0038E198DF.title: "&bShimmersteel"
	quest.5C2AE7715B3A8EED.quest_desc: [
		"Nautilus are new Mobs to &2&lMinecraft&r. &bAu&aro&dra&r gives us our own versions of them! \\n\\nRarely during &bAu&aro&dras&r, these Flying buddies will spawn. 30 Seconds after the &bAu&aro&dra&r stops they'll disappear. \\n\\nThey like &dAurora Shards&r and you have a 1/3 Chance to Tame them with one. \\n\\nOnce Tamed you can Right Click to Ride them like a normal Nautilus just floating in the Sky! You can even Boost with them by Holding Space. \\n\\nShift Right Clicking them will make them either Stay or Follow. "
		"{@pagebreak}"
		"If you don't want &5Auroral Nautilus&r to Spawn you can make and Eat a Roasted Snowball. \\n\\nI'm not sure how you \"Roasted\" a Snowball, but its an affront to Physics that will piss off &5Nautilus&r. Pretty hypocritical coming from a Flying Nautilus. \\n\\nIf you regret your cuisinal choices and want &5Auroral Nautilus&r to Spawn again, just Eat a Sugared Roasted Snowball. \\n\\nOh, so they didn't care about the Physics just the taste of it... that makes more sense."
	]
	quest.5C2AE7715B3A8EED.title: "&5Auroral Nautilus"
	quest.637EF6D9DFC59EE8.quest_desc: ["Rarely at Nights in Snowy Biomes the &bAuroral Event&r will occur. \\n\\nThe Sky will brightly shine &bBlue&r, &dPink&r, and &aGreen&r and there'll be similar colored Particles everywhere. \\n\\nWhen the &bAu&aro&dra&r is here a few things will Spawn, from new Plants to Mobs. With these and a few &2&lVanilla&r Items we can make new Gear, Blocks, and Items all Winter related!"]
	quest.637EF6D9DFC59EE8.title: "&b&lAu&aro&dral"
	quest.6E911A8079A1B237.quest_desc: ["&bInfused Ice&r gives us &bShimmering Ice&r! \\n\\n&bShimmering Ice&r is magical, it never Melts, gives off Light, and will even Hydrate Crops just like &9Water&r. \\n\\nWe'll also need it to Grow &2Glow Leeks&r, they will only Grow on &bShimmering Ice&r."]
	quest.6E911A8079A1B237.title: "&bShimmering Ice"
	quest.7555F22D066BD4AB.quest_desc: ["&5Hearthwood Logs&r are Campfires which use &dAurora Shards&r instead of &0Coal&r. \\n\\nThey do a whole lot of Effects. \\n\\n1. Each of them will increase the chance of an &bAu&aro&dra&r Spawning by 15%. This can be stacked up to 3 of them for 45%. \\n\\n2. It will scare off Phantoms same way Cats do. \\n\\n3. It will negate Damage from Powdered Snow near it."]
	quest.7555F22D066BD4AB.title: "&5Hearthwood Logs"
	quest.7758AC49F63ADC8A.quest_desc: ["&2Glow Leek Seeds&r are Crafted with &bFrozen Petals&r and &2Seeds&r. \\n\\nPlace them onto &bShimmering Ice&r to Grow them. \\n\\nEating them will give you Night Vision and Glowing Effects, Eating Candied versions will just give Night Vision plus a little extra Hunger Points. \\n\\nWe can also Brew Night Vision Potions with them!"]
	quest.7758AC49F63ADC8A.title: "&2Glow Leeks"
	quest.77E909CA721A721E.quest_desc: ["Pretty Lantern. \\n\\nIf you Hold it in your off Hand (or main Hand) you won't get the &0Darkness&r Effect."]
	quest.77E909CA721A721E.title: "&9Aurora Lanterns"
	quest.7BECDD4208BB1B24.quest_desc: ["&aShimmer Soil&r is made by using a &bShimmersteel Hoe&r on Snow. \\n\\nWe can't pickup &aShimmer Soil&r... \\n\\nIt acts like normal Farmland, it will need Hydration from &9Water &for &bShimmering Ice&r. Then, you can place any Crops on to it to Grow them. \\n\\n&aShimmer Soil&r has something normal Farmland doesn't though, that is a Growth Boost during &9Nights&r and an even greater Boost during &bAu&aro&dras&r! \\n\\nPlants will Grow 3 times faster at &9Night&r compared to &eDay&r and 5 times as fast during &bAu&aro&dras&r!"]
	quest.7BECDD4208BB1B24.title: "&aShimmer Soil"
	quest.7D5E772B4FB4CC77.quest_desc: [
		"This Quest has been authored by &6AllTheMods Staff&r, or a &2Community contributor&r for use in AllTheMods Modpacks. "
		""
